('ChuZhong_2','ChuZhong_2_433','fetch','fɛtʃ','fetʃ','[v] 取来；接来；到达；吸引; [n] 取得；诡计','This announcement fetched a huge cheer from the audience.  这一宣告博得听众极其热烈的欢呼声。'),
