('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_18','in other words','','','换句话说','Competitive intelligence or in other words knowing who your competitors are and what they do and how they do it is essential for any business.  竞争智能，或者换句话说，弄清楚谁是你的竞争者，以及他们做什么和怎样在做，是任何商业的要义。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_19','clumsy','''klʌmzi','''klʌmzɪ','[adj] 笨拙的','A clumsy waiter spilled wine all over her new skirt.  一名笨手笨脚的服务员把葡萄酒洒得她新裙子上到处都是。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_20','bump','bʌmp','bʌmp','[v] 碰撞；撞击','The roof was so low he bumped his head (=  his head hit the roof  ) .  屋顶很低，他都碰到头了。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_21','outgoing','''aʊt''goɪŋ','''aʊtgəʊɪŋ','[adj] 外向的；友好的；外出的；离开的','We’re looking for someone with an outgoing personality.  我们在找一个性格外向的人。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_22','adapt','ə''dæpt','ə''dæpt','[v] 使适应；改编','The ability to adapt is a definite asset in this job.  适应能力是做这份工作的绝对有利条件。'),
