('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_30','annoy','ə''nɔɪ','ə''nɒɪ','[v] 使……不悦；惹恼','What annoyed him most was that he had received no apology.  最令他生气的是没人向他道歉。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_31','annoyed','ə''nɔɪd','ə''nɒɪd','[adj] 颇为生气的','I’ll be annoyed if we don’t finish by eight.  如果我们8点还未完成，我会生气的。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_32','annoyance','ə''nɔɪəns','ə''nɒɪəns','[n] 烦恼','A look of annoyance crossed her face.  她的脸上掠过一丝不快。'),
