('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_41','in many ways','','','在很多方面','Yet, in many ways we are still at the beginning of this commitment.  然而，在许多方面，我们仍处在这一事业的发轫之初。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_42','psychology','saɪ''kɑlədʒi','saɪ''kɒlədʒɪ','[n] 心理（学）','experts in the field of developmental psychology  发展心理学领域的专家'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_43','psychologically','saɪkə''lɑdʒɪkli','saɪ''kɒlədʒɪklɪ','[adv] 心理（学）地；精神上地','"Simply being on antipsychotic medications could not have brought about such acceptance, " she stressed. "And this acceptance set me free psychologically.  “单纯的服用抗精神病药物不能诱使这种接受态度，”她强调“这种接受让我心理上释放了。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_44','make fun of','','','取笑','It''s cruel to make fun of a cripple.  取笑瘸子是残忍的。'),
