('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_47','mainstream','''menstrim','''meɪnstriːm','[n] 主流；主要倾向','Genet started as a rebel, but soon became part of the literary mainstream.  热内起初很叛逆，但不久就回归了文学主流。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_48','fulfilling','fʊl''fɪlɪŋ','fʊl''fɪlɪŋ','[adj] 令人满意的；令人愉快的','Nursing is still one of the most fulfilling careers.  护理仍是最令人有成就感的职业之一。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_49','never mind','','','不必担心','‘We haven’t done very well, have we?’ ‘Never mind. At least we tried.’  “我们做得不太好，是不是？”“没关系，至少我们尝试过了。”'),
('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_50','politics','''pɑlətɪks','ˈpɒlətɪks','[n] 政治','a good understanding of politics in China  对中国政治很好的了解'),
