('PEPGaoZhong_7','PEPGaoZhong_7_52','abolition',',æbə''lɪʃən','æbə''lɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 废除；废止','The abolition of slavery in Brazil and the Caribbean closely followed the pattern of the United States.  巴西和加勒比海地区对奴隶制的废除很大程度上遵循了美国的模式。'),
