('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1613','rainproof','''renpruf','''reɪnpruːf','[n] 雨衣；雨披; [adj] 防雨的；防水的; [vt] 使防水','a rainproof jacket  防雨短上衣'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1614','pollen','''pɑlən','''pɒlən','[vt] 传授花粉给; [n] [植] 花粉','The problem occurs because plants need to transfer pollen by wind and insect to fertilization and reproduce.  发生这样的问题是因为植物需要通过风和昆虫传递花粉进行受精繁殖。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1615','surrealist','sə''riəlɪst','','[n] 超现实主义者; [adj] 超现实主义的','Modern art stages this underlying spectre: one can imagine a surrealist painting of a frog embracing a bottle of beer entitled "A man and a woman".  现代派艺术所展示的正是这种潜在的幽灵：我们可以想象一幅青蛙抱酒瓶的超现实主义画作，而它的名字就叫“一个男人和一个女人”。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1616','Wednesday','''wɛnzde','ˈwɛnzdeɪ','[n] 星期三','Come and have supper with us on Wednesday, if you''re free.  星期三过来和我们一起吃晚饭，如果有空的话。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1617','hearse','hɝs','hɜːs','[n] 灵车；棺材','Father Fauchelevent, we must come to a decision: I must either be caught here, or accept this escape through the hearse.  割风爷，得拿定主意了：或是在这里等人家来捉，或是接受由灵车带出去的办法。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1618','magazine','''mæɡəzin','mægə''ziːn','[n] 杂志；弹药库；胶卷盒','a magazine article  杂志中的文章'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1619','tuft','tʌft','tʌft','[n] 一簇；丛生植物；一丛; [vt] 用丛毛装饰; [vi] 丛生','He had a small tuft of hair on his chin.  他下巴上有一小撮胡须。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1620','equip','ɪ''kwɪp','ɪ''kwɪp','[v] 装备，配备','They try to equip their vehicles with gadgets to deal with every possible contingency.  他们尽量给他们的车辆配备各种小装置以应付任何可能的突发状况。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1621','cross','krɔs','krɒs','[n] 交叉，十字；十字架，十字形物; [v] 交叉；杂交；横过; [adj] 交叉的，相反的；乖戾的；生气的','The by-pass crosses Wilton Lane shortly after a roundabout.  这条旁道绕过环岛后不久就和威尔顿巷相交。'),
