('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1632','irk','ɝk','ɜːk','[v] 使烦恼；使厌倦','The rehearsal process also irked him increasingly.  排练过程也更加让他厌烦。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1633','evermore',',ɛvɚ''mɔr','evə''mɔː','[adv] 永远，始终；今后','I will love you for evermore.  我将永远爱你。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1634','visualize','''vɪʒuəlaɪz','''vizjuəlaiz','[v] 形象，形象化；想像，设想','I tried to visualize the house while he was describing it.  我一边听他描述，一边想象那房子的样子。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1635','definitely','''dɛfɪnətli','''defɪnɪtlɪ','[adv] 清楚地，当然；明确地，肯定地','‘Do you reckon Margot will be there?’ ‘ Definitely not .’  “你估计玛戈会在那里吗？” “肯定不会。”'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_1636','promote','prə''mot','prə''məʊt','[v] 促进；提升；推销；发扬','You don''t have to sacrifice environmental protection to promote economic growth.  你们没有必要牺牲环保来促进经济增长。'),
